{"3428930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Attack: Survivor", "steam_appid": 3428930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/ebb6ff0b20cf06af9f160df4fc565ac5.avif?t=1775670222\" width=800 height=94 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.poster.avif?t=1775670222\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.webm?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/37573bd86356f0b802913561415e82a1.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete global quests to expand your selection of playable characters, each featuring a distinct playstyle and a loyal pet companion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Objective-Based Progress:</strong> Unlock new survivors and weapons by completing specific Quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Hero-Pet Synergy:</strong> Every character enters the arena with a unique pet that provides dedicated support and combat assistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/50644d22c8ed4cf37627b277e83ae633.avif?t=1775670222\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.poster.avif?t=1775670222\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.webm?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/c64be2f40ec3f4ca3e85a8f4db32062c.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cycle through weapons, spells, passives, and gear — adapting to each wave’s challenges.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌀 Area Weapons:</strong> Slam the ground to unleash shockwaves and <strong>obliterate groups of foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏹 Projectile Weapons:</strong> <strong>Snipe enemies</strong> from afar or <strong>unleash deadly volleys</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Sword &amp; Shield:</strong> A perfect balance of <strong>offense</strong> and <strong>defense</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Utility Weapons:</strong> <strong>AoE damage</strong>, <strong>enemy control</strong>, and <strong>buffs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔮 Summoning Staff or Spells:</strong> <strong>Call forth creatures</strong> to fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☠️ Poison weapon or Spells:</strong> Inflicts <strong>poison (DoT)</strong> on enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚡ Projectile Spells:</strong> <strong>Direct</strong>, <strong>high-impact attacks</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 Area Spells:</strong> <strong>Devastating bursts</strong> or <strong>sustained damage</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Utility Spells:</strong> <strong>CC enemies</strong>, <strong>heal</strong>, or <strong>provide ressources</strong> on top of dealing damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💫 Diverse passives and more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/cd5f87ab7eafa37fc0b6bf8acf6aec1c.avif?t=1775670222\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.poster.avif?t=1775670222\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.webm?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/95fa8d230c50185a82dbcaf71bd712c9.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival requires active control. Use tactical movement and defensive abilities to navigate through relentless waves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃‍♂️ <strong>Sprint:</strong> Gain speed and pickup range, as well as health regeneration and damage reduction at the cost of disabling your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💨 <strong>Dash:</strong> Use a quick dodge with invincibility frames to escape danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Defend:</strong> Use your shield to block incoming damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/26e79f45f55e9710f28d55e79fec0294.avif?t=1775670222\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.poster.avif?t=1775670222\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.webm?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/1df19709a476474f74b86fbb45c47d69.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dynamic objectives to maximize your hero's power throughout every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Wave Challenges:</strong> Complete specific mid-run challenges to earn powerful <strong>Legendary Passives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Stat Evolution:</strong> Every level-up presents you with stat cards, allowing you to choose how your hero’s attributes grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Volatile XP:</strong> Experience orbs turn hostile and fire projectiles at enemies if left uncollected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏴‍☠️ <strong>The Pirate Slime:</strong> Hunt down the thief to reclaim stolen gold with interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Dynamic Power-ups:</strong> Discover random drops from enemies or trigger unique passive abilities to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/04a56bfdba3e7e17113a1c6598f7fd12.avif?t=1775670222\" width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.poster.avif?t=1775670222\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.webm?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop and gear systems focus on efficient progression without inventory clutter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>Star-Rank Progression:</strong> Power up your equipment by &quot;feeding&quot; duplicate items of any rarity directly into your equipped gear. Increase its Star-Rank without taking up extra inventory slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Flexible Set System:</strong> Every set item provides a bonus starting at just one piece, with an upgraded bonus for equipping more (e.g., 3 pieces). This &quot;Mix and Match&quot; design removes the frustration of hunting for a single missing piece, allowing you to build your own custom synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>Blood Money:</strong> Take a calculated risk at the shop by sacrificing your Health in exchange for Gold to fund critical upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Smart Shop Rotation:</strong> Gain more control over randomness. Items you reroll are less likely to reappear, making it easier to find the specific gear your build requires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Your gear reflects on your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/e