401f43771822dc105e5773256165cf2.mp4?t=1775670222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop and gear systems focus on efficient progression without inventory clutter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>Star-Rank Progression:</strong> Power up your equipment by &quot;feeding&quot; duplicate items of any rarity directly into your equipped gear. Increase its Star-Rank without taking up extra inventory slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Flexible Set System:</strong> Every set item provides a bonus starting at just one piece, with an upgraded bonus for equipping more (e.g., 3 pieces). This &quot;Mix and Match&quot; design removes the frustration of hunting for a single missing piece, allowing you to build your own custom synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 <strong>Blood Money:</strong> Take a calculated risk at the shop by sacrificing your Health in exchange for Gold to fund critical upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Smart Shop Rotation:</strong> Gain more control over randomness. Items you reroll are less likely to reappear, making it easier to find the specific gear your build requires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Your gear reflects on your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dash, sprint, defend, and wield any weapon with 18 unique heroes, each with a loyal combat pet and fully visible gear. Deep strategic item and set bonus system, complete mid-run challenges, survive relentless waves, and face mighty bosses in this fast-paced arena roguelike bullet heaven!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/5fd5615631ac485d